            "detailed_description": "<h1>Strategy guides and other resources available at </h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather clues in the moonlit forest setting and discover a ghostly graveyard, hidden dark tunnels, and a sinister scheme. You as Nancy Drew are alone and trapped at a remote cabin in the dark woods, cursed by four haunting hounds with seemingly supernatural glowing eyes. In the isolation of Moon Lake, the dead and the secrets don’t always stay buried – and neither do their dogs. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nancy Drew®: Ghost Dogs of Moon Lake is a first-person perspective, point-and-click adventure game.  The player is Nancy Drew and has to solve a mystery. Explore rich environments for clues, interrogate suspects, and solve puzzles and mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\tA friend’s frantic note sends you, as Nancy Drew, on the trail of a mysterious pack of dogs whose glowing eyes and mournful howls threaten to chase you away forever.  Local residents say that the dogs have come back from the grave to protect the secrets of their master.  Are the ghostly legends true, or is there a flesh-and-blood explanation for the haunting howls? You must solve the mystery before the hounds catch your scent! Dare to Play™!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a cemetery and a speakeasy<br>\t\t\t\t\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take photos of birds and collect bugs<br>\t\t\t\t\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way through a forest maze<br>\t\t\t\t\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogate intriguing suspects<br>\t\t\t\t\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from Junior or Senior Detective difficulty levels<br>\t\t\t\t\t</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" 